# Disposable OS VM credentials

- Before provisioning or signing into a disposable installed-OS test VM, read `scripts/vm-test-credentials.json`: username `02tester`, password `Cs@12345`, sudo enabled.
- Load that fixture in automation. Do not invent a password or use older credentials from chat history, logs, screenshots, or snapshots.
- Reused legacy test VMs must have the canonical password applied and authentication verified before testing continues.
- Keep test credentials out of production accounts and live-image/installer account defaults.
- Preserve historical evidence; record changes in a new validation record.
- Current native VM window: `02_OS - Installed VM`. See `docs/VM_TESTING.md`.
